# wsjtx-web — agent defaults

- Read `AGENTS.md` first, then execute the next open item in `todo/00-overview.md`.
- Feature work: branch `type/description`, PR into `main` — do not push features straight to `main`.
- One todo/plan per PR when practical. Update the plan file status when done.
- Do not commit `node_modules/`, built `dist/assets`, binaries, or secrets.
- Do not run `npm audit fix --force` (can downgrade Vite).
- Prefer scoped diffs; no unrelated refactors.
- GridTracker often owns UDP `:2237` — use `-udp` / document port changes.
- `go:embed dist` requires `dist/index.html` (placeholder is tracked).
